  "Segment": [
    {
      "document_id": "DOC-3E8DBB0B7BF3829B4ADE",
      "normalized_text": "入谷后,谷主需要有人搬运库中药材。谷主把阵钥暂交林舟保管,同时以誓印禁止他离开雾谷;林舟能开启库门,却不能借阵钥越过谷界。任务结束时,谷主收回阵钥并解除誓印,林舟才恢复离谷的行动空间。",
      "normalized_text_hash": "sha256:cbc6208a205e2069e6f740c4cedf9fb2695ca66ea6418bd9c2adc14e49830023",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "parent_segment_id": null,
      "schema_version": "0.2-draft",
      "segment_id": "SEG-3E8DBB0B7BF3829B4ADE-001",
      "segment_type": "paragraph",
      "source_locator": {
        "end": 100,
        "kind": "text",
        "selector": "line:3",
        "start": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "document_id": "DOC-5299EAF60EE147CAD058",
      "normalized_text": "作者:xhnovel 测试组",
      "normalized_text_hash": "sha256:fea758207f074b34609f471a0a92852f7b9899dfb3cea62250a9fef556d4189a",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "parent_segment_id": null,
      "schema_version": "0.2-draft",
      "segment_id": "SEG-5299EAF60EE147CAD058-001",
      "segment_type": "paragraph",
      "source_locator": {
        "end": 20,
        "kind": "text",
        "selector": "line:2",
        "start": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "document_id": "DOC-4C8CA6CA2F23282047AD",
      "normalized_text": "青岚门命林舟护送青铜令前往雾谷。林舟把青铜令交给苏澜携带,苏澜因此实际持有令牌,但令牌仍属青岚门,她也无权催动。两人约定抵达谷口便由苏澜归还。",
      "normalized_text_hash": "sha256:b76fa7c5b744035a056347c12806c31549914b05c5abfde00175262e91c710ca",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "parent_segment_id": null,
      "schema_version": "0.2-draft",
      "segment_id": "SEG-4C8CA6CA2F23282047AD-001",
      "segment_type": "paragraph",
      "source_locator": {
        "end": 79,
        "kind": "text",
        "selector": "line:3",
        "start": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "document_id": "DOC-8098B1124BB403AE80B9",
      "normalized_text": "谷口石门只认令牌许可,苏澜第一次举令时没有反应。长老确认她守约后解除第一重禁制,只授予开启山门的权限,令牌的所有权仍未转移。石门随即开启,她却依旧不能调动门内守阵。",
      "normalized_text_hash": "sha256:b56b413d799da4c839b7307598659a980717eb065e793f32cd2888ade7843601",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "parent_segment_id": null,
      "schema_version": "0.2-draft",
      "segment_id": "SEG-8098B1124BB403AE80B9-001",
      "segment_type": "paragraph",
      "source_locator": {
        "end": 90,
        "kind": "text",
        "selector": "line:3",
        "start": 8
      }
    },
